+RE4 JPN RNG Search v5 - coverage-guided in-memory searcher
+===========================================================
+
+Target movie
+------------
+Neutral first-Ganado baseline (Leon runs forward, no drop).
+Automatic capture: movie frame 2818.
+Mutation window: even TAS slots 2822..2910.
+Budget: 20000 attempts.
+Target: 0x800D1EF0 r29 == 1 (Hand Grenade).
+Known Hand route seed: 0xBE9B.
+
+Mandatory self-checks
+---------------------
+1) baseline gate 0x42B3
+2) release B at 2866 -> gate 0x47AC
+3) press L at 2864+2866 -> gate 0xD62C, route 0xBE42, final ID 2
+
+The search aborts if any check fails.
+
+Search strategy
+---------------
+Phase 0: the three validation attempts above.
+Phase 1: about 1100 deterministic probes across the entire window:
+  - B release and L/R holds lasting 1, 2, or 4 slots
+  - analog X/Y deltas of 32, 64, or 96 in both directions
+  - centered analog X/Y holds
+  - the six exact 0xC085 route plans recovered from the v4 CSV
+Phase 2: deterministic coverage-guided fuzzing until the budget is exhausted.
+
+Every new gate/route/final signature is retained as a parent. Plans that reach a grenade route
+receive extra energy. The fuzzer adds, removes, edits, and splices mutations; it explores holds of
+1..6 slots and plans containing up to eight compatible mutations. Exact plans are never retried.
+Route seeds are selected uniformly before choosing a route parent, so a common route cannot drown
+out a rare one.
+
+Mutation labels
+---------------
+F2866:B_OFF       release B for one 30-fps slot
+F2866:B_OFFx4     release B for four consecutive slots
+F2842:L           press L for one slot
+F2850:SYm64x2     subtract 64 from analog Y for two slots
+F2888:SY_CENTER   center analog Y for one slot
+
+Logs
+----
+Logs/re4_jpn_rng_search_results.csv
+Logs/re4_jpn_rng_search_summary.txt
+Logs/re4_jpn_rng_search_FOUND.txt (only written on success)
+
+If no Hand is found, send both the CSV and summary TXT for the v6 analysis.
